# startup infobar flow, the InfoBarIdentifier registry, and Local State
# pref registration. All of the actual feature logic (network check,
# infobar delegate, installer launcher) lives in new files under
# nbrowser/overlay/chrome/browser/ui/startup/ - this patch only wires them
# in with the smallest possible touch to four upstream files, so it stays
# cheap to rebase across Chromium version bumps.

